<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 09-OCT.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 09-OCT.</headline>
<text>
<p>The extratropical remains of Josephine are racing past southern New England on a north northeast course at this time. This system is bringing locally heavy rain and gusty winds to southern and eastern New England, but any damage should be relatively minor.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
